<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">FAVORITES</view><view class="title">我的色卡</view><view class="subtitle">收藏的配色会保存在当前设备。</view></view><view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="grid"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="open"><view class="swatches"><view wx:for="{{item.colors}}" wx:key="*this" class="swatch" style="background:{{item}}"></view></view><view class="card-name">{{item.name}}</view><button size="mini" class="outline" style="margin-top:12rpx" data-item="{{item}}" catchtap="remove">取消收藏</button></view></view><view wx:else class="panel"><view class="section-title">还没有收藏</view><view class="muted">在色卡详情页点击“收藏”，你的配色会出现在这里。</view></view></view>
